           (d) “Cheeses in Brine” are semi-hard to soft ripened cheeses. The body has a white to yellowish
          colour and a compact texture suitable for slicing, with none to few mechanical openings. The
         cheeses have no actual rind and have been ripened and preserved in brine until delivered to, or
         prepacked for, the consumer. Certain individual cheeses in brine contain specific herbs and spices as
           part of their identity.”;

          (II) in item 2, under sub-item (c),-

              (1) in the table after entry (iv) relating to Cheese products, following shall be inserted, namely:-

             Product               Moisture Maximum,    Milk Fat Minimum,    Lactose, Maximum, % (m/m)
                       % m/m       % (dry basis)

  “v)  Whey cheeses

     a.  Creamed whey cheese                      -                   33                                 -

     b.  Whey cheese                                 -                   **                                 -

     c.  Skimmed whey cheese                      -                   ***                                 -

   vi)   Cheeses in brine

     a.   Soft cheese in brine                         -                   40                                 -

     b.  Semi-hard cheese in brine                  -                   40                              -“;


               (2) in the table, after existing entry (*), following shall be inserted, namely:-

               “**Milk fat inwhey cheese shall be minimum 10% and less than 33% on dry basis.

               ***Milk fat inskimmed whey cheese shall be less than 10% on dry”;

           (III)  underitem 6, the sub-item (a) shall be substituted by the following, namely:-

               “(a) The name of the food product shall be ‘cheese’, ‘whey cheese’ or ‘cheese in brine’, as applicable.
                 However, the word ‘cheese’, ‘whey cheese’ or ‘cheese in brine’ may be omitted in the designation
                     of an individual cheese variety as per sub-item (a) of item 1.”.

                                        PAWAN AGARWAL, Chief Executive Officer

